#: includes/class-aafwc-admin.php:258
msgid "When you type an address in our checkout or account address forms, the characters you type, a random session identifier and, when you choose a suggestion, the identifier of the chosen place are sent to Google (Google Places API) to suggest and complete addresses. Your browser also sends Google its IP address and browser information with these requests. Google processes this information under its own privacy policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy. We do not send your name, email address, phone number or order details to Google."
